# Vendored third-party sources. We neither author nor maintain these.
#
# Three attributes, doing three different jobs -- and one thing none of them do:
#   linguist-vendored   : keeps the file out of GitHub's language statistics
#   linguist-generated  : collapses the file by default in GitHub's "Files changed" view,
#                         so a reviewer sees our code instead of scrolling past a parser
#   -diff               : makes LOCAL `git diff`/`git show` treat it as binary
#
# GitHub's additions/deletions counter is computed from the raw diff and honours none of these,
# so the PR header will still report the vendored line count. That is cosmetic; what matters is
# that the review view collapses it. Do not chase the header number -- the only way to move it is
# to not commit the file, and third_party/fkyaml/README.md records why we do.
third_party/**                linguist-vendored linguist-generated
third_party/fkyaml/*.hpp      -diff linguist-vendored linguist-generated

# Ossie models copied verbatim from apache/ossie: test data, not our source.
test/fixtures/conformance/**  linguist-vendored linguist-generated
